{"symbol":"CWD","yahoo":"CWD.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"CWD Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","website":"https://www.cwdin.com","about":"CWD Limited, an information and communication technology company, engages in the designing, developing, manufacturing, and sale of wireless communication products, IoT-enabled devices, and integrated technology solutions in India. The company offers Sound Box, a wireless UPI/QR payment terminal that audio confirmation of digital payments; and SmartTemp+, a wireless, real-time body-temperature monitoring device that offers continuous readings for health-tech and institutional use cases. It also provides Smart ID Card, a wearable for employee safety and monitoring that offers proximity alerts, contact tracing, SOS functions, and firmware-over-the-air updatability; Tag, an asset tracker that is compatible with iBeacon and Eddystone protocols enabling real-time indoor, and in-transit inventory and asset-movement tracking; and CNIC Cards. In addition, the company offers smart prepaid meters; weather monitoring systems; and walkie-talkie. Further, it provides wireless modules; evaluation kits; mobile devices; and various services, such as electronics design, product design, software development, and manufacturing facility services. The company serves agriculture, animal husbandry, consumer product, healthcare and pharma, logistics and warehouse, telecom and IT, and utilities and lighting industries. Its products are used for consumer, enterprise, and industrial applications. The company also exports its products. The company was formerly known as CWD Innovation Limited and changed its name to CWD Limited in August 2021. CWD Limited was incorporated in 2016 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:39:49+00:00","quote":{"price":270.0,"prevClose":273.85,"marketCap":631.61,"high52":425.0,"low52":254.0,"pe":59.87,"bookValue":50.89,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":12.49,"shares